# Raiden Sara Xinyan Chevreuse. ~20s Rot. Raiden Overload with SubDPS Sara and Xinyan nuking before she takes the field. Xinyan's uninvested shield durabilty is suspect for ToM or EM builds, but it should linger enough for RES shred though Raiden's field time.

